          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सच में? (sac meṁ?) is sac, \"truth\", with meṁ, \"in\". sac comes from Sanskrit satya, \"true\" (CDIAL 13112), and meṁ from madhye, \"in, among\" (CDIAL 9804)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
