              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अरे (are) — \"oh!\", \"hey!\", a cry of surprise."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अरे (are), सच में? (sac meṁ?) — \"oh, really?\". It is informal: use it with friends."
            }
